{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40476","headline":"春日自吴门之阳羡道中书事 · 曹松","name":"春日自吴门之阳羡道中书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜异恣游应未遍，路岐犹去几时还。\n浪花湖阔虹蜺断，柳线村深鸟雀闲。\n千室绮罗浮画檝，两州丝竹会茶山。\n眼前便是神僊事，何必须言洞府间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}